cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tessero in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Tessero: numerical computing for PHP"
abstract: >-
  Tessero brings numerical computing to PHP 8.2+: n-dimensional arrays, linear
  algebra, FFT, NumPy-identical random numbers, sparse matrices, optimisation,
  linear and mixed-integer programming, and Markov decision processes. It runs
  on one small SIMD C library, libtessero, reached through FFI or a native Zend
  extension, and its results are checked against NumPy and SciPy.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Douglas Johnson"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/DMJ-CV-91913/tessero"
url: "https://tessero.org"
keywords:
  - php
  - numerical-computing
  - numpy
  - scipy
  - linear-algebra
  - ffi
